                                "sense_id": "bbc5387a-e276-3e6e-a8e4-c99cd85909c2",
                                "text": "[…] he is simply translating into Marxian terms the Sophistic view “that the more powerful will always take advantage of the weaker, and will give the name of law and justice to whatever they lay down in their own interests.”"
